   "text": "ANY TIME in talk: caller speaks photo words\n(\"\u092b\u094b\u091f\u094b \u092d\u0947\u091c\u0928\u093e \u0939\u0948\", \"I want to send photo\"), names\nvisual damage (crop pest, animal disease,\nhousing crack), or presses key 9",
