   "locked": false,
   "text": "SMS SENT VIA TWILIO\nSMS sent to caller's phone:\n\"Haqdaar: Photo link:\nhttps://<domain>/p/<token> . No internet: open\nHaqdaar app.\"\nAgent speaks fixed line: \"I have sent a link by\nSMS. Send the photo. I will call you back.\"",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
