   "originalText": "SMS SENT VIA TWILIO\nSMS sent to caller's phone:\n\"Haqdaar: Photo link: https://<domain>/p/<token> . No internet: open Haqdaar app.\"\nAgent speaks fixed line: \"I have sent a link by SMS. Send the photo. I will call you back.\"",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
