   "updated": 1759650000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MOBILE CAMERA & SELECTION\n- Big accessible buttons (>= 56px height):\n1. \"Take Photo\" (direct camera capture)\n2. \"Pick Photos\" (multi-select from\ngallery, up to 6)\n- Visual thumbnails with delete 'x' button\n(>= 44px)\n- Clear pictograms: [\ud83d\udcf7] Take, [\ud83d\udc41] Preview,\n[\u2713] Sent",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n_p_buttons",
   "originalText": "MOBILE CAMERA & SELECTION\n- Big accessible buttons (>= 56px height):\n  1. \"Take Photo\" (direct camera capture)\n  2. \"Pick Photos\" (multi-select from gallery, up to 6)\n- Visual thumbnails with delete 'x' button (>= 44px)\n- Clear pictograms: [\ud83d\udcf7] Take, [\ud83d\udc41] Preview, [\u2713] Sent",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
