   "updated": 1759650000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RURAL SOCIAL PROXY BRIDGES\n(alternative)\n1. Spoken 3-digit Case Token: Voice/SMS\ngives code \"412\"; family\nmember/neighbor uploads on smartphone\n2. Fertilizer Shop (Khad-Beej Dukandaar)\nKiosk: Standee QR; shopkeeper snaps\nphoto; Haqdaar calls farmer directly\n3. Krishi Mitra Push-Task: Village field\nworker visits and captures photo for\nfarmer",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n_p_proxy",
   "originalText": "RURAL SOCIAL PROXY BRIDGES (alternative)\n1. Spoken 3-digit Case Token: Voice/SMS gives code \"412\"; family member/neighbor uploads on smartphone\n2. Fertilizer Shop (Khad-Beej Dukandaar) Kiosk: Standee QR; shopkeeper snaps photo; Haqdaar calls farmer directly\n3. Krishi Mitra Push-Task: Village field worker visits and captures photo for farmer",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
