   "text": "SCHEME RAG MATCHING\n- Searches Chunk Index (chunk_index.py) using\nsearch keywords\n- Matches government compensation & support\nschemes (e.g. PM Fasal Bima Yojana - PMFBY,\ndisaster relief)\n- Case status advances to \"read\"",
