   "text": "OPERATOR DESK (tools/photo_desk.py)\nRunning on private port 8003 (localhost only\n127.0.0.1, isolated from public tunnel).\n- Operator sees case cards, photo thumbnails,\nmodal zoom\n- Shows AI finding, matched scheme, and draft\nsay text in caller's primary language\n- Keyboard controls: Enter approve, B not\nclear, Esc save, 1-6 zoom, A auto toggle",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n_p_desk",
   "originalText": "OPERATOR DESK (tools/photo_desk.py)\nRunning on private port 8003 (localhost only 127.0.0.1, isolated from public tunnel).\n- Operator sees case cards, photo thumbnails, modal zoom\n- Shows AI finding, matched scheme, and draft say text in caller's primary language\n- Keyboard controls: Enter approve, B not clear, Esc save, 1-6 zoom, A auto toggle",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
