   "text": "UNCLEAR PHOTO GRACEFUL RETRY\nAgent says: \"The photo was not clear\nenough to identify the crop/issue. Please\nsend a clearer, closer photo using the\nsame link or app.\"\nDrops bad photos, resets case to\n\"waiting\", link stays active.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n_p_bad_photo",
   "originalText": "UNCLEAR PHOTO GRACEFUL RETRY\nAgent says: \"The photo was not clear enough to identify the crop/issue. Please send a clearer, closer photo using the same link or app.\"\nDrops bad photos, resets case to \"waiting\", link stays active.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
