   "text": "CONTEXT CONTINUITY (NO RE-ASKING)\nLoads Call 1 context by call_id and preserved\nbox_vector (farmer, state, age, category).\nModel prompt includes separate <photo_finding>\nblock.\nCaller is NOT re-asked facts from Call 1!",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n_p_context",
   "originalText": "CONTEXT CONTINUITY (NO RE-ASKING)\nLoads Call 1 context by call_id and preserved box_vector (farmer, state, age, category).\nModel prompt includes separate <photo_finding> block.\nCaller is NOT re-asked facts from Call 1!",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
