   "text": "SEAMLESS RETURN TO DIALOG\nCall flows directly into LISTEN in the main talk\nloop.\nCaller can ask follow-up questions (\"how do I\napply?\", \"what papers are needed?\"), and\nsystem answers with full combined context.",
